<BaseLayout title="项目展示 — s7ae 网络科技工作室">
  <Header currentPage="/projects" />

  <main id="main">

  <section class="block" style="padding-top:calc(var(--hud-h) + 0px);">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="mono" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.85rem;">SECTION // 02 — ARSENAL</span>
        <h1>SELECTED <span class="serif" style="color:var(--text-titanium);">output</span></h1>
      </div>
      <p class="section-note">
        [ {projects.length} BUILDS ON RECORD ]<br />
        每一行是一份已交付的工程记录，点击进入规格页查看技术栈、状态与全量更新日志。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-list">
      {projects.map((project, index) => (
        <a href={project.href} class="project-row interactable">
          <div class="project-row-inner">
            <span class="project-row-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} //</span>

            <h2 class="project-row-name">{project.title}</h2>

            <span class="project-row-desc">{project.description}</span>

            <div class="project-row-thumb">
              {project.image ? (
                <img src={project.image} alt={project.title} loading="lazy" />
              ) : (
                <span class="project-row-thumb-fallback">NO VISUAL<br />AVAILABLE</span>
              )}
            </div>

            <div class="project-row-tags">
              <span class="project-row-status">[ {project.status} ] →</span>
              {project.tags.map((tag) => (
                <span class="tag">{tag}</span>
              ))}
            </div>

            <span class="project-row-enter" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-panel" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
    <h2>
      NOT ON THE<br />
      <span class="serif">record</span> YET.
    </h2>
    <div class="cta-side">
      <p>
        [ 更多项目受保密协议约束，不对外公示 ]<br />
        需要看同类工程的能力证明，请直接开一条通道。
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.6rem;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-solid magnetic interactable">
          <span>REQUEST CAPABILITY DECK</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

